course: dictionary
lesson: 16165
title: Worthless and worth
level: primary-4
stars: 0
explain: Worthless means having no value or use. Something worthless is not worth any money. The words around it give you clues. «The old ticket was worthless, because the show had already finished.» A finished show's ticket cannot be used, so it has no value.
explain: Look for clues in the sentence. «The dusty box looked worthless, but inside was a gold coin.» Here the word but tells you the box was not really worthless. Always test your meaning: put "had no value" in place of worthless and check that the sentence still makes sense.
explain: Worthless can also describe a person's feelings. «Ella said, "Nobody is worthless, not even on a bad day."» She means that every person has value. If you ever feel worthless, you should talk to a trusted adult, such as a parent, carer or teacher.
fact: Worthless means having no value or use.
fact: «Worthless» can describe a coin or ticket that is worth 0.
fact: In stories, a «worthless» old object often turns out to be treasure.
fact: Nobody is worthless: every person has value.
fact: If you ever feel worthless, talk to a trusted adult.
exercise: «The old ticket was worthless, because the show had already finished.» What does worthless mean here? | Very old | Very large | *Not worth anything | Very valuable
exercise: «The dusty box looked worthless, but inside was a gold coin.» Which word tells you the box was worth a lot in the end? | looked | box | dusty | *gold
exercise: Ella says, «Nobody is worthless.» What does she mean? | Everyone is very tired | Some people are worth less money than others | *Every person has value and matters | Nobody has any money at all
test:
«The fake gold ring was worthless, so the shop gave him nothing for it.» What does worthless mean? | Very shiny | Heavy and cold | *Having no value | Brand new
A ticket that is worth 0 is called worthless. What is its value? | 1 | 10 | *0 | 100
exam:
Ben says, «I feel worthless today.» What should he do? | *Tell a trusted adult how he feels | Keep it secret and never speak about it | Decide that he really is worth nothing | Stop talking to everyone he knows
